ps://app.getaura.com.br/crediario?empresa=11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111" class="a-lk" style="display:block;padding:12px 16px;color:#6d28d9;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border-radius:9px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;">Ver o crediário da Matriz</a></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;margin:0 8px 8px 0;border-collapse:separate;"><tr><td align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#f1ecfd" class="a-lkbg" style="background:#f1ecfd;border:1px solid #d8c9fa;border-radius:9px;mso-padding-alt:12px 16px;"><a href="https://app.getaura.com.br/crediario?empresa=22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222" class="a-lk" style="display:block;padding:12px 16px;color:#6d28d9;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border-radius:9px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;">Ver o crediário do Centro</a></td></tr></table></div></td></tr></table>
