<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="a-soft" style="background:#f1ecfd;border:1px solid #e4def5;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 14px;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 16px;"><p class="a-ink2" style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#51497f;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;">Vendas da semana</p><p class="a-ink" style="margin:0 0 4px;color:#1b1736;font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700;">R$&nbsp;4.100,85 <span style="color:#15803d;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;">&#9650; 20%</span></p><p class="a-ink2" style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#51497f;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;">Total do grupo, em 26 vendas, ticket médio R$&nbsp;157,73. Comparado com a semana anterior das 4 lojas que venderam nas duas semanas (R$&nbsp;3.244,85).</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="a-card a-line" style="margin:0 0 10px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e4def5;border-radius:10px;border-collapse:separate;table-layout:fixed;"><tr><td width="46%" class="a-soft a-ink2" style="padding:8px 10px;background:#f1ecfd;color:#51497f;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;">Loja</td><td width="30%" align="right" class="a-soft a-ink2" style="padding:8px 10px;background:#f1ecfd;color:#51497f;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;text-align:right;">Faturamento</td><td width="24%" align="right" class="a-soft a-ink2" style="padding:8px 10px;background:#f1ecfd;color:#51497f;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;text-align:right;">Vs. anterior</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" class="a-line a-ink" style="padding:9px 10px;border-top:1px solid #e4def5;color:#1b1736;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;">Matriz <span class="a-ink2" style="color:#51497f;font-size:12px;">· 11 vendas</span><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:4px 0 0;"